# Pebble integration-test artifacts. The binaries under tests/.tools/<version>/
# are downloaded by tests/Install-Pebble.ps1 and cached in CI by version key.
# The trust bundle is generated per-OS by tests/Build-PebbleBundle.ps1 and
# also lives under tests/.tools/. The static localhost cert/key under
# tests/.pebble/ ARE checked in — Pebble's TLS material has no real-world
# value (CN=pebble.test, only ever exposed to test code).
tests/.tools/
